{"seq":17,"slug":"system-performance","title":"系统性能与优化","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":5,"docCount":17,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance","rating":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.6,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"系统性能与优化-简介\">系统性能与优化 简介</h1><p>系统性能优化是软件工程中最具挑战性也最具价值的技能之一。它关注的不是功能的正确性，而是在正确性的基础上，让系统以更低的延迟、更高的吞吐量和更少的资源消耗来完成工作。从单个函数的微观优化到整个分布式系统的宏观调优，性能工程贯穿于软件开发的每一个层面。</p>\n<p>本手册面向有一定系统编程经验的软件开发者，特别适合需要解决线上性能问题、进行容量规划或构建高性能系统的工程师。你不需要是性能优化专家，但需要对操作系统、计算机体系结构和网络协议有基本的了解。</p>\n<p>全书共分为五个章节，建议按照顺序依次学习：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>性能工程基础</strong>建立性能分析的理论框架，介绍关键的性能度量指标、瓶颈分析的系统方法论，以及阿姆达尔定律和 USL 等基本定律。这些理论工具将帮助你在优化之前正确地定义问题和预测收益。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>CPU 性能优化</strong>聚焦于计算密集型场景的优化策略。本章涵盖性能剖析工具的使用方法、CPU 缓存优化技术、分支预测的原理与优化，以及 SIMD 向量化编程，帮助你从硬件层面理解和提升计算性能。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>内存性能优化</strong>探讨如何高效地使用系统内存资源。本章涵盖内存布局对性能的影响、不同场景下的内存分配策略，以及内存泄漏的检测与预防方法，这些知识对于构建长期稳定运行的系统至关重要。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>I/O 与网络优化</strong>讲解存储和网络层面的性能优化技术。本章涵盖磁盘 I/O 优化策略、网络协议栈的性能调优，以及异步 I/O 编程模型，帮助你解决 I/O 密集型应用中的性能瓶颈。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>系统调优</strong>从全局视角讲解操作系统和运行环境的调优方法。本章涵盖操作系统参数调优、容器化环境下的性能管理、可观测性体系的建设，以及负载测试的方法论，帮助你在生产环境中持续保障和提升系统性能。</p>\n<p>推荐从第一章的理论框架开始，建立正确的性能分析思维。然后根据你面对的具体性能问题，选择 CPU、内存或 I/O 章节深入学习。第五章的系统调优知识适合在掌握前四章的基础上综合运用。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-fundamentals","title":"性能工程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/performance-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-metrics","title":"性能指标与度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/performance-fundamentals/performance-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bottleneck-analysis","title":"瓶颈分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/performance-fundamentals/bottleneck-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"amdahl-and-ust","title":"阿姆达尔定律与 USL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/performance-fundamentals/amdahl-and-ust"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cpu-optimization","title":"CPU 性能优化","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"profiling-tools","title":"性能剖析工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/profiling-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cache-optimization","title":"CPU 缓存优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/cache-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"branch-prediction","title":"分支预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/branch-prediction"},{"seq":4,"slug":"simd-vectorization","title":"SIMD 向量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/simd-vectorization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-optimization","title":"内存性能优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/memory-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"memory-layout","title":"内存布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/memory-optimization/memory-layout"},{"seq":2,"slug":"allocation-strategies","title":"分配策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/memory-optimization/allocation-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-leak-detection","title":"内存泄漏检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/memory-optimization/memory-leak-detection"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"io-optimization","title":"I/O 与网络优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"disk-io-optimization","title":"磁盘 I/O 优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/disk-io-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-optimization","title":"网络优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/network-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"async-io-patterns","title":"异步 I/O 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/async-io-patterns"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"system-tuning","title":"系统调优","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/system-tuning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"os-tuning","title":"操作系统调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/system-tuning/os-tuning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"container-performance","title":"容器性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/system-tuning/container-performance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-for-perf","title":"可观测性与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/system-tuning/observability-for-perf"},{"seq":4,"slug":"load-testing","title":"负载测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/system-tuning/load-testing"}]}]}